  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Finance - Blue economy for Marine Protected Areas in Indonesia to regenerate coral reefs and improve food  security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds and manages Marine Protected Areas (MPAs) that regenerate coral reef ecosystems and improve the lives and food security for local communities. The initiative bridges the marine conservation financing gap through innovative, Blue Economy reef-positive businesses in and around the MPAs. The project contributes to the effective management and financial sustainability of MPAs in Indonesia starting with a network of MPAs in Banggai, Central Sulawesi, Indonesia (600,000ha)</narrative>
  </description>
